WEBVTT

00:05:59.197 --> 00:06:03.263
is allowing fans to collect
memorabilia of his great moments

00:06:03.297 --> 00:06:04.597
in music history,

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.563
similar to the way that NBA Top Shot

00:06:07.563 --> 00:06:12.963
is allowing basketball fans to collect
historical replays as NFTs.

00:06:13.597 --> 00:06:17.130
In the metaverse,
humans are represented as avatars.

00:06:17.463 --> 00:06:19.430
An eight-year-old probably knows,

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.730
but did you know that you can buy
clothes for your avatar?

00:06:22.763 --> 00:06:24.330
This is Kadine James.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.463
She is leading the way in digital fashion

00:06:26.497 --> 00:06:29.563
that can only be worn
in the virtual world.

00:06:29.597 --> 00:06:33.930
Today, Gucci sells sneakers
that only exist in the virtual world,